IconSets use  list property to set icons, So each  object has individual 
property. By default the  list property holds three objects and those object's  property
set "0", "33" and "67" respectively. In our example, we set "20" and "70" to  property of second and third objects in 
 list property.

        using (ExcelEngine excelEngine = new ExcelEngine())
